@page "/"

<PageTitle>BookIt – Book rooms, equipment & services</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="BookIt: reserve rooms, equipment and services by time slot, with automatic double-booking prevention." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="/" />
</HeadContent>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h4" Class="mb-2">BookIt</MudText>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
    Book rooms, equipment and services without double-booking. Browse resources, check availability
    and reserve a time slot — no account needed to look around, but you'll need to log in to book.
</MudText>

<MudPaper Class="pa-4" Elevation="1">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">Getting started</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
        1. Browse <MudLink Href="/resources">Resources</MudLink> to see what's available.<br />
        2. Log in (or register) to reserve a time slot.<br />
        3. Track your reservations under <MudLink Href="/my-bookings">My bookings</MudLink>.
    </MudText>
</MudPaper>
